#: src/quick-start/installation.md:10
msgid ""
"**Build the `rut` CLI** from a checkout of this repository — the "
"**temporary-run** lane: running module directories and bundles, `fmt`, "
"`dump`, `pack`. The fastest way to poke at the language; not the way anyone "
"ships."
msgstr ""

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:15
msgid ""
"Both lanes build the same engine, and the crates are not published to "
"crates.io — the git dependency is the only consumption path."
