"marks _dispatch-inverted_ members — anything a runtime fires or owns rather "
"than you calling it. Event props (`on_click$`), lifecycle hooks "
"(`on_mount$`, `before_destroy$`), subscription updates (`on_update$`), watch "
"controls (`start$`, `stop$`), engine atoms (`viewport_size$`), and mutation "
"handles generally. Never on functions _you_ call, widget builders, or types."
