#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:14
msgid ""
"**Teardown** — `Vm::drop` frees the heap in slab units; nothing per-object "
"leaks past the VM."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:16
msgid ""
"**Leak reporting** — the shutdown leak report ([weak "
