#: src/reference/host-fns.md:148
msgid ""
"The registered callable's Rust shape **is** the `.d.rut` row. The "
"**installer lane** is a `HostPkg` builder per pkg — rows under bare names, "
"the scope (the pkg's name) spelled once — installed through "
"`HostRegistry::install_host_pkg`:"
