#: src/reference/host-fns.md:167
msgid ""
"`pkg_async_fn!` is the async twin: one row spelling emits the five-row "
"family (`__start`/`__yield`/`__take`/`__cancel` + the decl-row trap), the "
"same expansion the ctx declares. The raw macros — `register!` / "
"`register_async!` on the bare registry (see [embedding and native "
"modules](embedding.md)) — remain the escape hatch (hand-spelled "
"`<scope>::<name>` strings, the flat table's own responsibility); everything "
"above them is the same derived-signature machinery:"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/host-fns.md:179
msgid "\"server::make\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/host-fns.md:183
msgid ""
"The signature is a fixed array of type ids derived from the closure's "
"parameter and return types; a param type with no crossing impl is a "
"**compile error at the register site**."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/host-fns.md:186
msgid ""
"Both body shapes fit: `-> R` (infallible) and `-> Result<R, Trap>` "
"(fallible). Errors travel an explicit trap channel — a trapped body "
"propagates as `Err(Trap)` with a rut backtrace ([embedding and native "
"modules](embedding.md))."
