"Execution: `main` is called with no arguments; then the async driving loop "
"runs — drain the ready queue, advance the virtual clock to the next timer "
"deadline, repeat until no frames and no tasks remain. The loop is capped, so "
"a program that never idles fails loudly instead of hanging."
msgstr ""

