#: src/reference/cli.md:151
msgid ""
"the `sha256` pin is the loader's law at the mount door; when it refuses, the "
"CLI maps the url back to its cache path, deletes the entry, and exits 2 — "
"the next run re-fetches and heals"
msgstr ""

